{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/340qe8","slideIndex":0,"text":"Hello. My project analyzes the MovieLens 20M movie ratings dataset. I used PySpark to calculate summaries, Cassandra to store them, and charts to explain the results."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/rzypmb","slideIndex":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/6tkbml0r","name":"Blank"},"title":"Project goal","textShapes":4,"backgroundColor":"rgba(251,252,253,1)"}
