{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rzypmb","slideIndex":1,"text":"The goal was to turn a large collection of individual ratings into useful summaries. I focused on four questions: which movies have how many ratings, how genres compare, which scores are most common, and how average ratings vary by release year."}
