{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kzm5wry9","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":76,"top":147,"width":500,"height":42},"text":"What the analysis shows","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#168C8C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l0v65wfu","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":78,"top":205,"width":515,"height":182},"text":"4.0 stars was the most common score.\nFilm-Noir had the highest genre average.\nDrama received the most ratings.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#17324D","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/614ny1gf","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":660,"top":147,"width":540,"height":42},"text":"What the analysis cannot show","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#168C8C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/72xo76x0","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":662,"top":205,"width":540,"height":210},"text":"Averages do not explain why someone liked a movie.\nGenres have different numbers of ratings.\nA high average can come from fewer ratings.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#17324D","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8n650by5","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":78,"top":500,"width":450,"height":64},"text":"Thank you","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":40,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#12243A","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/soaptx","slideIndex":8,"text":"To conclude, 4.0 stars was the most common rating. Film-Noir had the highest average, while Drama had the most ratings. This analysis summarizes patterns but cannot tell us why a person gave a score. Genre averages also need context because the genres have different numbers of ratings. Thank you. I am ready for questions."}